          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তৎপর — tôtpôr — \"prompt; quick to act\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "যদি দমকল তৎপর না হত, তাহলে আগুন ছড়াত। Jôdi dômkôl tôtpôr nā hôtô, tāhôle āgun chhôṛātô. If the fire brigade hadn't been quick, the fire would have spread."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "তৎপর (tôtpôr) is a tatsama, Sanskrit tatpara, \"following on that, intent on it\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
